title: v5.39.0 — multi-tenant University framework bridge release
summary: 'Multi-tenant University framework shipped as the additive bridge release. Per D5 locked decision (805 downloads/month on @a-company/university), v5.39.0 lands pack.yaml manifest + three-source discovery + cross-pack <pack-id>:<entry-id> addressing + CLI selectors + new paradigm_university_pack_list MCP tool + PLSAT content migration (ran once, old JSON retained for bridge) + compliance schema fields + LoreEntry.references + TeamDecision.supersedes[] + privacy-preserving local metrics + docs guide. 48 new paradigm-mcp tests + 31 university regression tests with SECURITY sentinel assertions. Two real bugs caught by the load-bearing PLSAT harness (migration dropped answer banks for alternate-schema lessons; normalizeFrontmatter dropped v6 fields on read) — both fixed before release. v6.0 follows with breaking removals: LoreType.decision hard-remove, loadPortalConfigLegacy deletion, --delete-sources finalization, legacy content layout removal.'
